WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
Preparing for preapproval starts with knowing what

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.660
the lender actually needs from you.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.300
Requirements can differ with your situation.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.240
For each requested item, ask: Do I

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.120
have it? Is it current?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.700
Or do I need help getting it?

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.000
A pay stub you saved earlier may

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.480
need updating. If your income or job

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.640
has changed, mention that when asking what

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.440
to provide. Keep unclear requests on the

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.260
question list instead of assuming they're complete.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.840
The preparation worksheet helps you see what's

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.760
still missing. Review your answers before sending

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.240
them to me, or print the list

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.330
for yourself.
